   "fontFamily": 1,
   "text": "DECIDED\n- Publish: Google Play + App Store (iOS via cloud Mac)\n- Engine: Godot 4.5.1 (Compatibility renderer)\n- Landscape orientation\n- One joystick = move the swarm\n- Auto-fire: ALL clones shoot the NEAREST zombie\n- Clone count = health, touch = clone dies\n- Swarm limit = tuned value, game = CHAOS\n- Free CC0 models (Kenney / Quaternius) + Blender",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
