   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "text": "v0.2 PLAN (your feedback + new ideas)\n\nYOUR FIXES\n- Harder + longer: 8 waves, zombies keep\n  increasing during each wave\n- Zombies spawn OFF SCREEN (from the forest)\n- Rescue lone soldiers: +1 early,\n  +3 / +5 rows only later\n\nNEW STUFF\n- EXPLODER zombie: blows up, chain reactions\n- POWER-UPS: Rapid fire, Shield, Freeze,\n  Airstrike\n- Explosive barrels to shoot\n- COINS from zombies (saved)\n- MAIN MENU + UPGRADE SHOP\n  (firepower, starting squad, starting gun)\n- LEVELS 1, 2, 3... each one harder\n- Boss RAGE at half health\n- Pause button, screen shake, '-1' popups,\n  arrows pointing to off-screen pickups\n- Sound effects",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
